correlator `C(m) = <o|B^m|o>/lambda_B^m` with `delta = 0.25` and `o = E_mu(k) psi_0`. Items 1 and 2 are exact integer and bit arithmetic; items 3 to 5 are floating-point at the stated tolerance.
